<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>{{subject}}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F4F6F9; color: #2C3E50; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A3C5E 0%, #2E86C1 100%); padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
        .header .app-name { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .header .app-tagline { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
        .body { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #1A3C5E; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #555E6D; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .otp-box { background: #F0F7FF; border: 2px dashed #2E86C1; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A3C5E; letter-spacing: 10px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
        .otp-expiry { font-size: 13px; color: #9BA3AF; margin-top: 8px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A3C5E, #2E86C1); color: #FFFFFF !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 28px 0; }
        .warning-box { background: #FFF8E7; border-left: 4px solid #F39C12; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .warning-box p { font-size: 13px; color: #7D6608; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { background: #F8F9FA; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #EAEDF0; }
        .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: #9BA3AF; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer-text a { color: #2E86C1; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="app-name">{{appName}}</div>
            <div class="app-tagline">{{appTagline}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
            {{{body}}}
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.<br/>
                Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez cet email.<br/>
                &copy; {{year}} {{appName}} — Tous droits réservés.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
